{"3826380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lunaton: Rescue mission", "steam_appid": 3826380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Dear players</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please accept our apologies for any errors, this game is being developed by two people! Please do not scold us too much.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/c6c3945c1c07362def709f738c43d9c1.avif?t=1781081570\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.poster.avif?t=1781081570\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.webm?t=1781081570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.mp4?t=1781081570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📅 Seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time in the game moves in real time, but nature moves faster! Every 7 days, the archipelago experiences a complete season change, bringing new weather, unique harvests, seasonal fish, and special activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏡 City and a Lively Daily Routine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your island isn’t isolated, and there’s a large city nearby. Its inhabitants follow a schedule: in the morning, they come to your island for a walk or a coffee break, some tend to the chickens on the farm, and others start their shifts in your stores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/322c59429312a1609b4f1563db583926.avif?t=1781081570\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.poster.avif?t=1781081570\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.webm?t=1781081570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.mp4?t=1781081570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚂 Secrets of a Large Archipelago</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re tired of the routine, simply hop on a train and explore the neighboring islands. Each has its own unique character. For example, the fog-shrouded Magica Island will greet you with the atmosphere of an ancient cemetery and mystical secrets. For romance and picturesque views, head to the island with a lighthouse, perfect for relaxing fishing. Luxury lovers will love the island hotel, transformed into an elite resort for the wealthiest guests. And for true adventurers, there’s a dangerous island of mysteries, where you’ll have to solve puzzles, battle ancient enemies, and search for valuable artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/20f578349020b6578e373b93ab4c7ad8.avif?t=1781081570\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/ac8e6e8d0b4dc44e2f4685af3d82fe1f.poster.avif?t=1781081570\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/ac8e6e8d0b4dc44e2f4685af3d82fe1f.webm?t=1781081570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/ac8e6e8d0b4dc44e2f4685af3d82fe1f.mp4?t=1781081570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Evening Profit Collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a successful manager! Develop the island’s infrastructure, open coffee shops and stores. Your employees work all day, and in the evening, you visit the establishments to collect the daily profits and invest them in new projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌾 Island Busy Time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm, reap a bountiful harvest, obtain valuable resources, and care for animals. Everything you grow or find can be sold profitably or used to improve your island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/c6c3945c1c07362def709f738c43d9c1.avif?t=1781081570\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.poster.avif?t=1781081570\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.webm?t=1781081570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.mp4?t=1781081570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📅 Seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time in the game moves in real time, but nature moves faster! Every 7 days, the archipelago experiences a complete season change, bringing new weather, unique harvests, seasonal fish, and special activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏡 City and a Lively Daily Routine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your island isn’t isolated, and there’s a large city nearby. Its inhabitants follow a schedule: in the morning, they come to your island for a walk or a coffee break, some tend to the chickens on the farm, and others start their shifts in your stores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/322c59429312a1609b4f1563db583926.avif?t=1781081570\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.poster.avif?t=1781081570\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.webm?t=1781081570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.mp4?t=1781081570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚂 Secrets of a Large Archipelago</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re tired of the routine, simply hop on a train and explore the neighboring islands. Each has its own unique character. For example, the fog-shrouded Magica Island will greet you with the atmosphere of an ancient cemetery and mystical secrets. For romanc